msgid "When using RADIO TWO with Serial CW (real RS232 or USB), this controls the function of the DTR pin. Note by convention, DTR is typically used for CW."
msgstr "When using RADIO TWO with Serial CW (real RS232 or USB), this controls the function of the DTR pin. Note by convention, DTR is typically used for CW."

#. Config command: RADIO TWO KEYER RTS   (default: PTT)
